  {
   "id": "b3",
   "function": "explanation",
   "scene_type": "file_beside",
   "duration_hint": 13,
   "spoken": "The NCSC lists the consequences: attackers can often work out the new password from the old one. New passwords are more likely to be written down or forgotten. And many people choose a weaker one they can remember.",
