   "function": "insight",
   "scene_type": "comparison",
   "duration_hint": 14,
   "spoken": "The US standards body NIST is just as clear. Its guideline SP 800-63B says users must not be required to change passwords periodically. A change is forced when there is evidence the password has been compromised.",
